A certificate that feels like a sense of meaning - first aid certificate
This is one of the important skill certificates I have besides my driving license!
Let's spread this knowledge: First aid is actually emergency rescue in case of emergencies, that is, rescue before the ambulance arrives.
It is well known that there is a period of time between the accident and the arrival of the ambulance, and it is this period that is the most critical.
This is when emergency care is needed.
If I really have a heart attack, stroke or cardiac arrest, then we only have four minutes, the golden four minutes!
So how important it is to have people around you who know first aid!
When someone falls down around us, we can use our professional knowledge to try to save them, instead of just standing there and doing nothing, which is a terrible feeling of helplessness.
"In China, our official data shows that there are three million accidental deaths every year, and the most dangerous one is called cardiac arrest.
In the United States, the average is 15%.
In the casino hotels in Las Vegas, 70-80 percent can be saved, while in Shanghai and Beijing, it is less than 1 percent."
This is what the founder of First Response, Lu Le, said.
If a person has cardiac arrest, there is no breathing and no heartbeat, and pinching the philtrum will not work.
Artificial respiration and chest compressions are necessary to save a person.
I found that there are very few people who have this awareness to learn first aid. But when things happen, it is too late. So I still call on everyone to learn this skill so that we can respond in a timely manner when we face emergencies.
It could even save a life!
You can register for the first aid certificate at your local Red Cross training center. I registered at the Red Cross training center in Zhuhai, and students can get a discount.
PS: The last picture is a record of my goals to be achieved before I turn 25, and adding first aid certificate to the list of goals was also a few months ago, but it has been completed!
Next, I will go to take other certificates that I want to take. I plan to take a diving certificate. I saw on Xiaohongshu that there is also a diving first aid certificate. It seems that you need to have a first aid certificate before taking this certificate. So, the first aid certificate is really useful!
