Inspection well concrete module production and processing equipment Zhengzhou well wall brick module equipment introduction:
Zhengzhou Yixin is a professional manufacturer of concrete inspection shaft module brick equipment, inspection shaft block machinery, shaft wall module machinery, and from semi-automatic to fully automatic production lines.
After years of practice and development, it has now become a quality-oriented enterprise, mainly producing hydraulic, mobile, and fully automated inspection shaft series equipment and supporting devices.
Inspection of concrete module production and processing equipment for well wall bricks Zhengzhou well wall brick module equipment assembly site:
Inspection well concrete module production and processing equipment Zhengzhou well wall brick module equipment features and advantages:
Yixin inspection well block brick machine equipment is widely applicable to new building materials for municipal underground structures such as coal, heat, water, electricity, and gas.
For example, various inspection wells of drainage and storage facilities, rainwater inlets, square ditches, septic tanks and small structures, bridge wing walls, etc.
The advantage of using concrete modules to build inspection wells is that the top and bottom as well as the left and right sides of the module are all concave and convex slot structures, which can be combined and built to form a chain lock.
The shear strength of the shaft wall is far better than the form of construction of the flat friction masonry.
The module is a hollow structure. After the combination of the module, the vertical holes are connected and the horizontal holes are penetrated. After the core of the hole is poured, it forms a cast-in-situ concrete network structure, which plays a role of secondary reinforcement and waterproofing.
The module is provided with a stirrup groove in both the vertical and horizontal directions, and the overall strength of the structure is correspondingly improved by the horizontal and vertical stirrups.
In addition, the inspection wells and drainage wells built with concrete inspection well modules are not prone to collapse, sinking, leakage and other phenomena. The mechanical properties of the well wall module are stable, the operation is simple, and the forming size is standard.
The concrete inspection well module brick machine equipment intelligent control is equipped with data input and output devices, one-button-through touch LCD display to monitor mechanical operation of the entire process, realize ideal human-machine dialogue, automatic analysis of material, density operation, safe logic control and fault diagnosis system.
The well wall wall module mechanical hydraulic system adopts single cylinder hydraulic and delivery, double cylinder hydraulic and delivery.
The independent hydraulic integration station avoids the impact of the main machine vibration on the hydraulic system, thereby ensuring the reliability of the hydraulic system.
The concrete inspection well module brick machine equipment material distribution box traveling mold box demolding rise, storage box door closed, automatic conveying pallet, all by hydraulic system independently completed, so as to reduce mechanical wear and maintenance.
The concrete inspection well module brick machine equipment adopts imported computers, electrical appliances, seals and hydraulic parts to ensure the stable and reliable comprehensive performance of the equipment.
The mechanical vibration platform of the well wall module adopts integral plate steel, and the tabletop wire cutting molding has no welding points, so that the stuffing box can swing freely and guide, which fully reduces mechanical wear.
This reduces the load on the mold, combines the packing and double encryption amplitude, and adopts integrated and fully synchronous table vibration and mold vibration to ensure the compaction effect.
The wall module of the well is mechanically excited by machinery, and the amplitude is automatically controlled by computer according to the cost performance of raw materials. There is no wear braking, so that the service life is prolonged and the cost is reduced.
The well wall module has dual functions of mechanical automatic control and manual control.
