Ingredients for beauty and skin care soup:
The functions of Tremella: sweet in taste and neutral in nature, it enters the lung, stomach and kidney meridians; it has the functions of strengthening the essence, replenishing the kidney, moistening the intestines, benefiting the stomach, replenishing qi, harmonizing blood, strengthening the heart, nourishing yin, moistening the lungs, generating body fluids, tonifying the body, tonifying the brain, invigorating the spirit, beautifying the skin, prolonging life and health; it is used to treat lung heat cough, lung dryness dry cough, women’s menstrual irregularity, gastritis, constipation, etc.; it is a good tonic for patients with yin deficiency and hyperactivity who cannot be treated with ginseng and deer antler, etc.
The function of peach gum: bitter taste, neutral nature, belonging to large intestine and bladder meridian.
Effect: It can help to stop bleeding, promote blood circulation, stop dysentery, stop pain, and also can supplement water and moisten the intestines. If you have constipation, you can eat more peach gum.
The functions of wolfberry are: neutral in nature, sweet in taste, and attributed to liver and stomach meridians.
It can improve liver function and vision, nourish the liver and kidney, whiten the skin, replenish the body and produce saliva, and delay aging.
The functions of red dates: sweet in taste and neutral in nature, they enter the spleen and stomach meridians, and can replenish the spleen and stomach, benefit qi, generate body fluid, nourish blood and calm the mind. If you have weak spleen and stomach, insufficient qi and blood, and insomnia, you can take more red dates.
The functions of longan meat: sweet and warm in nature, it enters the heart and spleen meridians, and is suitable for those with deficiency of both heart and spleen.
Longan fruit can also moisturize the skin, beautify the skin, nourish blood and calm the mind, supplement the heart and spleen, strengthen the yang and enhance the qi, and is suitable for people with anemia and insomnia.
The function of lotus seeds: sweet and astringent, neutral in nature, return to the heart, spleen, and kidney meridians.
Nourishing the heart and calming the mind, it is used for palpitations, insomnia, stomach deficiency, forgetfulness, restlessness, thirst, nourishing and replenishing deficiencies, stopping leakage and consolidating essence.
Therefore, this beauty soup is not only a dessert, but also a health tonic!
