Education commentary: What can be done to save abducted children?
If we compare it with the famous public service advertisement slogan of "no buying, no killing", then in an environment without the demand for "kidnapping", the prevention and control of kidnapping, and the prevention of kidnapping by all people will make the act of trafficking in persons unprofitable, risky and costly, so this kind of crime will not happen repeatedly.
Recently, the Missing Children Emergency Release Platform developed by the Anti-Abduction Office of the Criminal Investigation Bureau of the Ministry of Public Security was launched.
This is an Internet information platform created for the establishment of an authoritative channel for the release of information on missing children and the timely recovery of abducted children.
Upon hearing that the name of this app is “Tuan Yuan”, I felt warm.
The new technology is not only named “literary and artistic” and full of sentiment, but also properly applied in information technology, practical and effective.
The primary goal of anti-abduction law enforcement is to find abducted children and protect their personal safety and freedom.
Secondly, the trial and punishment of the suspects.
The significance of criminal punishment can be listed as many "big words" from individual punishment, social prevention to legal education.
However, before the trafficking case is solved, priority should be given to the personal safety of the victims.
Things have their priorities. In the urgent "rescue" purpose, topics such as "whether the death penalty should be imposed on all cases of child trafficking" can be put aside for cautious discussion; but the rescue of trafficked children cannot wait.
According to the experience of investigating such cases, human traffickers are accustomed to leaving the scene of the crime as soon as possible after they succeed.
The longer the search and rescue operation takes, the further the child may be from his parents, and the more difficult it is to solve the case.
In this case, it is a practical action to come up with an effective method such as the "reunion" platform, which can directly help to solve the case and find the child.
After all, "anti-abduction" is a major task that requires the entire legal system to be put into operation.
To combat crime and safeguard the interests of children and parents, from the improvement of legislation to the guarantee of justice and the meticulousness of law enforcement, all need to implement the care of "protecting the young and helping the weak".
In addition, the prevention of child trafficking can be improved from family to society.
For example, a common case is that a family of three rests at the railway station. The parents are fast asleep and wake up to find that their child has disappeared.
A two-year-old cannot be expected to have sufficient self-protection skills, but as a parent of a young child, you should at least have a reasonable awareness of protection.
Parents should take turns to rest or put children in safe protection, which is the minimum means of preventing children from being kidnapped.
From another aspect of the police's fight against trafficking crimes, the side that purchases abducted children should also be concerned and punished.
A single act of wrongdoing is often just one link in a long chain.
According to China's Criminal Law, the legal penalty for the crime of child trafficking is 5 years; in cases of especially serious circumstances, the penalty may be death and confiscation of property.
The starting point of the sentence is high, and the maximum sentence is heavy. In the general trend of "lightening the sentence", the crime of abducting children is obviously a crime with a heavy sentence.
However, there are still many cases of human trafficking every year.
It can be seen that some people have backward concepts in raising children and weak legal awareness.
The legal education of this group should be carried out in parallel.
To effectively control trafficking crimes, it is not enough to rely on strict law enforcement by the government.
If the "market" of abduction is widespread, the abductors are greedy and constantly innovate the means of abduction, forming a "duel" situation with the law enforcement, the anti-abduction action will inevitably fall into the inefficient quagmire.
Therefore, breaking away from backward ideas and popularizing legal knowledge will also help to eradicate the crime of child trafficking and buying.
Yang Haodong delivered a speech on the spirit of the 6th Plenary Session of the 19th CPC Central Committee and the Provincial Party Congress at Malanshan
and draw strength from the history of the Party’s hundred-year struggle.
Hunan Daily, December 10 (All-media reporter Gong Baiwei) According to the unified arrangement of the Provincial Party Committee, Yang Haodong, member of the Standing Committee of the Provincial Party Committee and head of the Propaganda Department of the Provincial Party Committee, gave an interactive presentation in Malanshan Video Cultural and Creative Park on the morning of December 10, to thoroughly study and implement the spirit of the Sixth Plenary Session of the 19th CPC Central Committee, the spirit of General Secretary Xi Jinping's important speeches, instructions and directives for Hunan, and the spirit of the 12th Provincial Party Congress.
Yang Haodong explained the core essence and practical requirements of the spirit of the plenary session in a simple and comprehensive manner, from three aspects, namely, ideals and beliefs and original mission, self-revolution and youth party, and the party's leader and the party's theory, combined with his own insights and personal experiences.
He pointed out that the spirit of the plenary session and the spirit of the important speech and important instructions of General Secretary Xi Jinping to Hunan, as well as the spirit of the Provincial Party Congress, should be studied together, and that the spirit should be studied in a comprehensive and integrated manner, so as to enhance the ideological awareness, political awareness, and action awareness of upholding the “two major establishments” and achieving the “two major safeguards”, and to move forward unwaveringly in the direction pointed out by General Secretary Xi Jinping.
During the interactive session, representatives of grass-roots cadres, enterprises and young people asked questions about the relationship between the three historical resolutions, how to understand the decisive significance of "two establishments", how cultural enterprises should grasp the orientation, and how young people in the new era should draw strength from the century-long history of the Party. Yang Haodong answered these questions one by one with popular language and vivid examples. He earnestly told young party members that they should draw the power to forge ahead from the century-long struggle history of the Party, closely unite around the Party Central Committee, unswervingly follow the Party, and write their responsibilities and commitments with their youth.
The number of graduates from universities and colleges in Beijing is expected to reach 268,000 in 2022 - Xinhuanet
Xinhua News Agency, Beijing, December 11 (Reporter Yang Na) - The reporter learned from the video conference on employment and entrepreneurship of graduates in 2022 held recently by the Beijing Municipal Education Commission and the Beijing Municipal Human Resources and Social Security Bureau that the number of college graduates in Beijing is expected to reach 268,000 in 2022, an increase of 16,000 over last year.
According to the relevant person in charge of Beijing Human Resources and Social Security Bureau, Beijing will deploy the employment work for college graduates from aspects such as strengthening supply and demand matching, strengthening policy support, broadening employment channels, ensuring assistance to the needy, supporting innovation and entrepreneurship, and improving service efficiency.
The reporter learned that the Beijing Municipal Human Resources and Social Security Bureau will build a practice platform, increase job supply, take the initiative to contact 40 workplace experience bases for college graduates, visit employers, and integrate demand information and job information; focus on "six batches", namely, expand the recruitment of public institutions, expand the recruitment of state-owned enterprises, expand the recruitment of grass-roots projects, expand the recruitment of conscripts, expand the employment probation and retention, and expand the entrepreneurship-driven employment; implement "one policy for one life" dynamic management, recommend no less than 5 job information for each graduate, and ensure that 100% of the graduates from poor families who are willing to work will be helped.
