Let the university spirit resonate with the spirit of the times - Xinhuanet
The so-called university spirit refers to a series of educational concepts and values that have been accumulated over time during the development process of a university, which is the soul of the university.
From ancient times to the present, the university spirit is crucial for the development of politics, economy, culture, science and technology, society, and even the progress of a nation.
Since the birth of the world's first modern university, universities have taken on a unique mission different from other social organizations. For our country's universities, which emerged in the autumn of national crisis, their spirit is deeply influenced by traditional culture and changes in the times, advocating the value concept of "moral integrity and helping the world, self-cultivation, family management, state governance, and peace" and the patriotic responsibility of "revitalizing education and strengthening the nation".
At present, the trend of higher education informatization and internationalization is becoming increasingly obvious. The global competition in education, science and technology, and talent is constantly intensifying. As an important "supply side", the structural reform of higher education is facing unprecedented opportunities and challenges.
In particular, the proposal of the Overall Plan for Coordinating the Construction of World-class Universities and First-class Disciplines has demonstrated China's confidence and determination to move from a large country with higher education to a powerful country with higher education, and has also put forward higher and newer requirements for the development of universities.
How can we strive to rank among the world’s top universities in a relatively short time, accelerate the construction of several world-class universities and a number of world-class disciplines on the basis of still having certain gaps, and achieve “overtaking on a curve”?
In addition to firm confidence in goals, paths and capabilities, universities should also give full play to three advantages: first, latecomer advantage, by continuously introducing outstanding overseas academic talents, learning from the advanced experience of world-class universities, and achieving a significant improvement in academic level and school-running quality; second, cultural advantage, inheriting the wisdom of Chinese civilization accumulated over five thousand years, carrying forward and developing excellent traditional culture, so as to gather strength, shape brands and enhance image; third, institutional advantage, giving play to the institutional superiority of socialist countries, strengthening goal-driven, pooling consensus and joint efforts, optimizing resource allocation, and providing sustainable and solid guarantee for schools to accelerate catching up with the world's advanced level.
It is particularly important to realize that it is impossible to build a world-class university in the same way. While playing to their strengths, each school must also show their individuality and characteristics.
The characteristics of running schools should have common Chinese characteristics and also reflect their own unique goals, educational traditions and resource endowments.
For Zhejiang University, we focus on highlighting three aspects in our university management: first, we focus on highlighting the characteristics of talent training for innovation and entrepreneurship, build an integrated education environment combining science and education and industry and enterprise, and form a full-chain entrepreneurship education ecosystem; second, we focus on highlighting the characteristics of interdisciplinary convergence, promote the optimization and adjustment of the academic system, create an institutional environment for interdisciplinary convergence, and actively cultivate new interdisciplinary emerging disciplines and landmark interdisciplinary achievements; third, we focus on highlighting the characteristics of the university management system and social service, carry out in-depth international exchanges and cooperation, and accelerate the formation of a pan-Zhejiang University industry-university-research cooperation system.
In this process, it is particularly important to always adhere to the university spirit and make the university spirit resonate with the spirit of the times.
For Zhejiang University, the school motto of "seeking truth and innovation", the common values of "studying hard, cultivating virtue, making a clear distinction, and being earnest", and "embracing rivers and lakes, enlightening truth and virtue, opening up things for the people, and building our country" together constitute the latest expression system of Zhejiang University spirit.
This is an important guarantee for the school to adhere to the correct direction of running the school, constantly accumulate cultural heights and concentrate spiritual power. It is rich in connotation and has far-reaching significance.
Among them, "Haina River" emphasizes the spirit of openness and inclusiveness, reflects the mind of "using talents from all over the world", and is manifested as drawing on the high-quality concepts of running schools and educating people of world-famous universities; "Qizhen Houde" emphasizes the spirit of truth-seeking and goodness, which means that while pursuing truth, universities should also receive moral cultivation and personality; "Kaiwu Qianmin" reflects the spirit of reform and innovation, which includes the pursuit of knowledge, scientific research innovation, and is manifested as reform and development, and the overthrow of the old and the establishment of the new; "Shuwo Bangguo" emphasizes the spirit of patriotism and dedication, which means that universities should always be with the nation's destiny.
These series of spiritual concepts and values are exactly the soul of Zhejiang University’s 120-year-old history.
"The wise hear in silence and the wise see in the unformed."
Chinese universities should further base themselves on the overall situation of socialism with Chinese characteristics, deeply understand the era position and historical mission of higher education, and accelerate the construction of world-class universities.
At the same time, we should adhere to humanistic care and independence and freedom, and let the university spirit and the spirit of the times and the national spirit interact with each other, so as to provide endless motivation for the realization of national prosperity and national rejuvenation, and the realization of the common ideal of mankind.
