Have you encountered any problems with the continuing education hours for the initial registration of first-level cost?
Those who register late should provide a certificate of continuing education. Those who register late should provide a certificate of continuing education of no less than 30 hours in the past year. Those who re-register should provide a certificate of continuing education of no less than 120 hours in the past four years. Those who re-register should provide a certificate of continuing education of no less than 30 hours for each full year.
Cost Engineer Continuing Education Fee Standard
The cost engineers who participate in online continuing education must pay the learning fees to each management institution when they register. Generally, the standard is: 300 yuan/person/year for 30 hours of compulsory courses (including the unified continuing education textbook);
The cost of 30 hours of elective courses is 300 yuan/person/year.
The cost of 30 class hours of compulsory courses and 30 class hours of optional courses is 600 yuan/person/year (including the unified textbooks for continuing education).
(I) Participate in the online continuing education of registered cost engineers organized by the China Cost Engineering Association or provincial and departmental management institutions, and calculate the class hours according to the time recorded in the online learning courseware;
(2) Participating in the centralized face-to-face training of registered cost engineers organized by the China Cost Engineering Association or provincial and departmental management institutions, as well as various types of training courses, seminars, etc., 4 academic hours can be recognized for every half day;
(3) Participate in the further education of cost engineers and cost accountants of China Cost Engineering Association and provincial and departmental cost engineers, and 10 class hours can be recognized for every half day;
(4) Participate in the research of the China Price Association and provincial-level topics, the compilation of industry standards, and the compilation of teaching materials, with 30 hours recognized each year for each item;
(6) Participate in the preparation of textbooks, as well as the preparation, review and evaluation of the national cost engineer qualification examination, and 30 class hours can be recognized every year;
(7) Professional papers and books related to project cost with personal signature and published (according to the official publication number).
For every 10,000 words of published works, 12 class hours will be recognized;
The publication of papers in national-level journals is recognized as 8 hours per thousand words, the publication of papers in provincial-level journals is recognized as 5 hours per thousand words, and the publication of papers in municipal-level journals is recognized as 3 hours per thousand words;
(IX) Participants in the public training (excluding general management and skills training for enterprises) organized by the construction cost consulting enterprises approved or authorized by the China Cost Engineering Association, provincial-level and departmental management institutions, and provincial cost engineering associations may be recognized for 4 class hours per half day, with a maximum of 30 class hours per year.
Cost Engineer Network Continuing Education Learning Process
After the registration agency receives the fee, the student identity will be activated immediately. The cost engineer can enter the online education classroom with the user name and password.
The students learn through the video-on-demand courseware, question and answer, online discussion, etc.
If you forget your password, and you cannot log in to study because the username and password are incorrect, please contact the registration institution to which you belong. The registration institution can help you change your password (but cannot change your username) and then you can log in again using your changed password.
