Commentator of People's Daily: "14th Five-Year Plan" Achieves a Good Start - On Studying and Implementing the Spirit of the Central Economic Work Conference - Xinhuanet
Xinhua News Agency, Beijing, December 11 -- People's Daily, December 12 -- Commentator's article: "14th Five-Year Plan" achieves a good start -- On studying and implementing the spirit of the Central Economic Work Conference
"Realize a good start of the 14th Five-Year Plan", the Central Economic Work Conference held from December 8 to 10 highly appraised the achievements made by China's economic and social development over the past year.
General Secretary Xi Jinping delivered an important speech at the meeting, profoundly summarized the economic work in 2021, analyzed the current economic situation in depth, and made major arrangements for the economic work in 2022, which pointed out the direction of progress and provided fundamental guidance for us to do a good job in next year's economic work and welcome the successful convening of the 20th National Congress of the Communist Party of China.
We solemnly celebrate the 100th anniversary of the founding of the Communist Party of China, officially announce the completion of building a moderately prosperous society in all respects and achieving the first centenary goal, and embark on a new journey to comprehensively build a modern socialist country and achieve the second centenary goal.
We convened the Sixth Plenary Session of the 19th CPC Central Committee to summarize the major achievements and historical experience of the Party’s century-long struggle, and adopted the third historical resolution on the major achievements and historical experience of the Party’s century-long struggle, namely, the Resolution of the CPC Central Committee on Major Achievements and Historical Experience of the Party’s Century-Long Struggle, which is a political declaration for the new era of Chinese Communists to remember their original aspiration and mission, adhere to and develop socialism with Chinese characteristics, and a guide for us to learn from history, create a better future, and achieve the great rejuvenation of the Chinese nation.
Over the past year, the world has been undergoing unprecedented changes and the global pandemic of COVID-19 have intertwined to affect each other, making the external environment more complex and severe. The tasks of epidemic prevention and control and economic and social development in China are extremely heavy and arduous.
The Party Central Committee with Comrade Xi Jinping as the core has adhered to the overall planning of domestic and international situations, the general keynote of seeking progress while maintaining stability, calmly responded to the changes in the past century and the pandemic in the 21st century, coordinated epidemic prevention and control with economic and social development, accelerated the construction of a new development pattern, strengthened the cross-cycle adjustment of macro policies, focused on promoting sustainable and healthy economic development, focused on deepening reform, opening up and innovation, and strived to complete the arduous tasks of reform and development, and achieved new major achievements in all undertakings of the Party and the country.
The good start of the "14th Five-Year Plan" is reflected in the following important aspect: the new development pattern has taken new steps, and high-quality development has achieved new results.
China’s economic development and epidemic prevention and control have maintained a leading position in the world, with strong resilience, great potential and sufficient momentum; national strategic scientific and technological forces have been rapidly strengthened, major innovation achievements have emerged, scientific and technological innovation capabilities have been continuously enhanced, and key core technologies have achieved new breakthroughs; the resilience of the industrial chain has been enhanced, foreign trade volume has increased and quality has improved, the structure has continued to be optimized, and new kinetic energy represented by new industries, new formats and new models has grown and expanded; reform and opening up have been advanced in depth, efforts have been made to remove the blockages that restrict supply and demand adaptation and factor flow, and new advantages in cooperation and competition have been created through high-level opening up; people’s livelihoods have been effectively guaranteed, employment scale has continued to expand, residents’ income growth has been basically synchronized with economic growth, grain production has remained above 1.3 trillion catties for seven consecutive years, and China has achieved “eighteen consecutive harvests”; ecological civilization construction has been continuously promoted, carbon peak and carbon neutrality work has been coordinated, green and low-carbon transformation has been steady, and new achievements have been made in ecological environment protection.
These achievements are the result of the strong leadership of the Party Central Committee with Comrade Xi Jinping as the core, the result of the scientific guidance of Xi Jinping Thought on Socialism with Chinese Characteristics for a New Era, and the result of the concerted efforts and hard work of the whole Party and people of all ethnic groups in the country.
Practice has once again proved that the Party's establishment of Comrade Xi Jinping as the core of the Party Central Committee and the whole Party, and the establishment of Xi Jinping Thought on Socialism with Chinese Characteristics for a New Era as the guiding ideology, is of decisive significance to the development of the cause of the Party and the country in the new era and to the historical process of promoting the great rejuvenation of the Chinese nation.
With General Secretary Xi Jinping as the core of the Party Central Committee and the whole Party, with the scientific guidance of Xi Jinping Thought on Socialism with Chinese Characteristics for a New Era, and with the unity and tenacious struggle of the whole Party and people of all ethnic groups in the country, we will surely be able to overcome all kinds of difficulties and obstacles, and create new glories of the times and build new historical achievements on the new journey of building a modern socialist country in an all-round way.
