I have always been against any form of slander and abuse, and I can't accept such personal attacks.
In a civilised society, we can tolerate anything, but we must not tolerate this kind of scum.
If we do not look at political parties and factions, the first thing to resist is this uncivilized style.
I've taken the approach of not responding to you since you started sending me Facebook friend requests, then posting snarky posts, and then trying to post my home location and father's name on social media.
You continued to tag me at a frequency of six meals per day, and you continued to discuss some obscure and humiliating comments about me with your so-called friends on Facebook, such as my appearance, body shape, whether I was good at giving birth, and whether I should have sex or not. I... forget it.
I was surprised to receive a message from several friends about your Facebook account, which contained a photo of you and sexual harassment comments.
Sorry, as a woman I can't keep quiet any longer.
After I reported to the police, you did not stop, but became more and more arrogant.
I don't care what your political background is, I don't care what your status is, in our society, we need respect for both genders.
Yes, you can continue to make these snarky, veiled, humiliating, and abusive comments, you can continue to say that you just care about me, you can continue to think that this isn't harassment, you can even continue to deny that you made those images or continue to spew all of your hate.
Yes, I can't and I don't have the power to stop you.
I don't know you and I don't want to know you, and I don't need you to judge me on my looks or my body.
I don't even think there's a girl out there who would be willing to be so humiliated in order to get famous.
My friend asked me, are you okay?
I said yes, and you wouldn't believe it.
I don't think any girl could say she was okay after being bullied like that.
In the workplace, in society, in politics, in business, only someone who is lacking in basic decency would choose to hurt any woman in this way.
I believe that justice is in the hearts of people.
I cut some comments for everyone to comment on.
No one can impersonate you for your own post, right?
I can only say that you are the enemy of civilization.
