"Intelligent Gathering in Hunan" 2021 China International Rail Transit and Equipment Manufacturing Industry Talent Summit opened - Rolling News - Hunan Daily Online - Huasheng Online
Hunan Daily, December 10 (All-media reporter Zhou Zhouheng) On the 9th, the "Intelligent Xiangtan" 2021 China International Rail Transit and Equipment Manufacturing Industry Talent Summit opened in Zhuzhou.
Wang Cheng, member of the Standing Committee of the Provincial Party Committee and Minister of the Provincial Party Committee Organization Department, attended the launch ceremony and delivered a speech.
Wang Cheng pointed out that holding the talent summit is an important measure to implement the spirit of the Central Talent Work Conference and the 12th Party Congress of the province, and it shows Hunan’s sincerity in valuing talents, seeking talents, and making good use of talents.
Hunan has a good tradition of recognizing, loving and respecting talents, a broad platform for talent development, and environmental conditions for realizing a better life. In recent years, it has deeply implemented the talent-led development strategy, built a talent work pattern of attracting, cultivating and retaining talents along the entire chain, and become a fertile soil for talent growth and achievement, a hot land for innovation and entrepreneurship, and a paradise for living and working.
At present, Hunan is comprehensively implementing the strategic positioning and mission of “three highs and four new”, and will further open the door to recruit talents and introduce more excellent talents, introduce more policies, concentrate more resources, and create better conditions for talent innovation and entrepreneurship. We look forward to the outstanding talents from all walks of life to work together to pool their wisdom and make efforts for the high-quality development of Hunan.
Changsha, Zhuzhou, Xiangtan exhibition halls and Hunan Free Trade Pilot Zone exhibition hall were set up at the event site. The Provincial Department of Science and Technology, the Provincial Department of Industry and Information Technology, and the Provincial Department of Human Resources and Social Security released the key demand list for scientific and technological innovation in related industries of advanced manufacturing, the talent demand catalog of intelligent manufacturing industry, and the talent demand catalog of young people in intelligent manufacturing industry of post-doctoral mobile stations.
48 large enterprises such as China Railway Rolling Stock Corporation, Zoomlion Heavy Industry Science & Technology Co., Ltd. and Far East Group were on site to recruit talents, and nearly 1000 graduates and social talents participated in the talent project matching.
